      "frame": 113,
      "text": "Breacher, this is Control. The Harbormaster holds the berth. Cut its three uplinks — yard, shed, quay."
    },
    {
      "frame": 472,
      "text": "It has seen you. Gulls fly, Hounds walk. Put them down."
    },
    {
      "frame": 722,
      "text": "One relay dark. It felt that — machines inbound."
    }
